= Oracle (blockchain) — Simple =

A blockchain oracle brings outside information into a blockchain application. A smart contract might use an oracle for a price or event result. The oracle is a data bridge, not a guarantee that the data is true.

'''Important boundary:''' oracle ≠ truth source by definition.

